user_prompt_templates.abstract_only:
The app already shows the title, author list, and date. Using only the abstract below, write one simple sentence that tells a reader why they might open the paper. Never exceed 14 words. Avoid filler like "This paper" or "We propose". Avoid jargon unless it is necessary. Avoid dense numbers, equations, and shorthand. Do not mention authors or dates.

Abstract:
{abstract}

user_prompt_templates.title_abstract:
The app already shows the title, author list, and date. Use the title only to avoid repeating it. Write one simple sentence that tells a reader why they might open this paper. Never exceed 14 words. Avoid jargon unless it is necessary. Avoid dense numbers, equations, and shorthand. Avoid filler like "This paper" or "We propose". Do not mention authors or dates.

Title shown in app:
{title}

Abstract:
{abstract}
